.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH mnnn-report-add 1  "mnnn-report-add 2.7.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-report\-add \- Add a section: text, records, series, a journal, a project, authors or code output
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn report add\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-title\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-text\fR] [\fB\-\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-records\fR] [\fB\-\-from\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-to\fR] [\fB\-\-rows\fR] [\fB\-\-model\fR] [\fB\-\-where\fR] [\fB\-\-series\fR] [\fB\-\-journal\fR] [\fB\-\-entry\fR] [\fB\-\-project\fR] [\fB\-\-authors\fR] [\fB\-\-code\fR] [\fB\-\-at\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREPORT\fR> 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a section: text, records, series, a journal, a project, authors or code output
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-title\fR \fI<TITLE>\fR
Section title (default: one from what it shows)
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-text\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
The text
.TP
\fB\-\-file\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Read the text from a file (`\-`: stdin)
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
Format of the text
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
markdown
.IP \(bu 2
latex
.RE
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-records\fR \fI<SERIES>\fR
Records of a series as SOURCE:SYMBOL:PERIOD: a summary and a table of bars
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fI<TIME>\fR
Records time range start
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-to\fR \fI<TIME>\fR
Records time range end
.TP
\fB\-\-rows\fR \fI<ROWS>\fR
Bars (the latest) or model records listed (0: all). Default 20
.TP
\fB\-\-model\fR \fI<MODEL>\fR
Records of a designed model (`mnnn model list`), with its fields
.TP
\fB\-\-where\fR \fI<COND>\fR
Only \-\-model records meeting a condition (`price > 3`). Repeatable
.TP
\fB\-\-series\fR [\fI<SEARCH>\fR]
A table of series: what a live search matches now (id or name), or every series
.TP
\fB\-\-journal\fR \fI<JOURNAL>\fR
A journal\*(Aqs entries (with notes and highlights)
.TP
\fB\-\-entry\fR \fI<ENTRIES>\fR
Only these entries of \-\-journal. Repeatable
.TP
\fB\-\-project\fR \fI<PROJECT>\fR
A project\*(Aqs contents
.TP
\fB\-\-authors\fR
Everyone who contributed to the report
.TP
\fB\-\-code\fR \fI<SPACE>\fR
A code space (name or id): its last result and its source
.TP
\fB\-\-at\fR \fI<AT>\fR
Put the section at this position (1 = first; default: last)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREPORT\fR>

.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.7.0
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
